LEGALIZE — European Union: legislation as open data

SOFTWARE / PIPELINE
The software that generates and maintains this repository is open source
under the MIT License:
  https://github.com/legalize-dev/legalize-pipeline

LEGISLATIVE CONTENT (DATA)
EUR-Lex consolidated texts and EU-owned editorial content: CC BY 4.0; EUR-Lex metadata: CC0 1.0. See the official legal notice and any document-specific restrictions.
These are official public-sector texts reproduced from their official
source. The original source of each document is recorded in the `source`
field of that file's YAML front matter.

DISCLAIMER
Automated reproduction of official sources. This is not an official or
verified legal text. Always consult the official source for authoritative
versions.
